        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "尽快 + action",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "尽快 asks for action as soon as circumstances permit. It does not state that the action is already complete.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "请尽快回答。",
                "pinyin": "qǐng jǐnkuài huídá 。",
                "meaning": "Please reply as soon as possible.",
                "audio": "0edf4444af3889d4e14b62eca526d4d7f32a355ea6dd39a2f171d51056157566"
              },
              {
                "text": "我会尽快完成工作。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ huì jǐnkuài wánchéng gōngzuò 。",
                "meaning": "I will finish the work as soon as possible.",
